# A tape file that requires gum and glow to be in the $PATH
Require contctrl

Set WindowBar Colorful

Output demo.gif

Type "contctrl"
Sleep 1000ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms

Type "contctrl run"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter

Sleep 3500ms

Type "dnt"
Sleep 1500ms

Type "i"
Sleep 1000ms

Type "t"
Sleep 2000ms
Enter

Type "de"
Sleep 2500ms
Enter

Sleep 12000ms
